---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BOOKING_URL } from '../consts';
import { withBase } from '../utils/paths';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="How it works"
  description="Intake, build, launch, and optional Care Plan — the JustinCredible Web delivery path for local businesses."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Process</p>
    <h1>How it works</h1>
    <p>Four steps. Clear handoffs. You always know what’s next.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="steps">
    <article class="step">
      <h3>1. Intake</h3>
      <p>
        Fill out the short Get Started form (or email). Share what you do, who you serve,
        and whether you need a new site, automation, or both.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="step">
      <h3>2. Scope & confirm</h3>
      <p>
        You’ll get a plain-language proposal: package, timeline, what’s included, and what’s not.
        Work starts after you confirm.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="step">
      <h3>3. Build & review</h3>
      <p>
        Draft pages go up for your feedback. We tighten copy, CTAs, and forms until it feels right
        on a phone — because that’s how most customers will see it.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="step">
      <h3>4. Launch & Care</h3>
      <p>
        Site goes live. You get a short handoff. If you choose a Care Plan, monthly edits and
        checks continue so the site doesn’t go stale.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <section class="prose-block section-block" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <h2>What I need from you</h2>
    <p>
      Logo (if you have one), business hours, services list, contact preferences, and any photos
      you’re proud of. If you don’t have those ready, we can start with clear text and add assets later.
    </p>
    <h2>Typical timeline</h2>
    <p>
      Launch Site: about 1–2 weeks after materials are in. Online System: closer to 2–3 weeks,
      depending on automation complexity. Rush work only when both sides agree in writing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <h2>Start with intake</h2>
    <p>Takes a few minutes. Prefer a live chat? Book a call instead.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href={withBase('get-started')}>Get started</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={BOOKING_URL} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Book a call</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
